	(text "Switches Configuration Notes:\n\n1 nor 2 closed: 	NC - DRP\n1 closed:			Low - UFP\n2 closed: 			High - DFP\n3 nor 4 closed: 	Default - 900mA\n3 closed: 			Medium - 1.5A\n4 closed: 			High - 3A\n5 open:				High - MUX Disabled (Shutdown)\n5 closed:			Low - MUX Enabled (Active)\n6 open:				High - CC Disabled (Shutdown)\n6 closed:			Low - CC Enabled (Active)"
